Netflix has officially shared a first look at its upcoming 6-part adaptation of Jane Austen's Pride & Prejudice! The series stars Emma Corrin as Elizabeth Bennet and Jack Lowden as Mr. Darcy, with a massive supporting cast including Olivia Colman and Rufus Sewell.

Mark your calendars for December 3, 2026, as the Regency-era drama makes its way to the streaming service. Directed by Euros Lyn (Heartstopper), this looks to be a major production for Austen fans.

